8
00:04:36,200 --> 00:04:41,800
ぴちぴち跳ね回る 真っ赤なイチゴ飴
Bouncing around, a bright red candy apple.

9
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:46,000
さあそっと待ってね ずっと待ってた
Come on, wait softly, I've been waiting forever!

10
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:51,800
ほらね今年も 花火が打ち上がる
Look, fireworks are launching again this year!

11
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:59,450
さあ祭だ祭だ祭だ わっしょいみんなの出囃子で声出して
Come on, it's a festival! Washhoi! Shout out with everyone's entrance music!

12
